WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.719
Week 8: Family, Description, and Possession. describe people and relationships express possession identify a person precisely

2
00:00:08.719 --> 00:00:32.423
Read for the situation. La familia de Inés es grande y vive en varios países. Su prima mayor es médica, sus hermanos son estudiantes y su mejor amigo participa en todas las celebraciones. Inés's family is large and lives in several countries. Her older female cousin is a doctor, her brothers are students, and her best friend takes part in every celebration.

3
00:00:32.423 --> 00:00:41.057
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:41.057 --> 00:00:46.661
Reading activities. Reading activity 18; Reading activity 19

5
00:00:46.661 --> 00:00:54.549
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:54.549 --> 00:01:20.828
Model language. La familia de Inés es grande. — Inés's family is large. Vive en varios países. — It lives in several countries. Su prima mayor es médica. — Her older cousin is a doctor. Sus hermanos son estudiantes. — Her brothers are students. Su mejor amigo participa en cada celebración. — Her best friend participates in every celebration.

7
00:01:20.828 --> 00:01:30.726
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
